usage: memory-base [-h] [--home HOME] [--runtime-python RUNTIME_PYTHON]
                   [--fresh-runtime] [--wheel WHEEL] [--model MODEL]
                   [--profile {agent-bubble,codex,dsh,opencode,reader}]
                   [--components COMPONENTS] [--lines LINES]
                   [--timeout TIMEOUT] [--destination DESTINATION]
                   [--backup BACKUP] [--name NAME] [--root ROOT]
                   [--include INCLUDE] [--exclude EXCLUDE] [--replace]
                   [--read-scope READ_SCOPE] [--write-scope WRITE_SCOPE]
                   [--deny-read] [--deny-write]
                   [--mode {enable,disable,status}]
                   {install,start,stop,restart,status,logs,host-token,backup,restore,source-add,source-list,source-remove,access-set,autostart}

positional arguments:
  {install,start,stop,restart,status,logs,host-token,backup,restore,source-add,source-list,source-remove,access-set,autostart}

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --home HOME
  --runtime-python RUNTIME_PYTHON
                        Explicit existing runtime; versions are checked
                        against pins
  --fresh-runtime       Select the dedicated <home>/runtime venv instead of an
                        adopted runtime
  --wheel WHEEL         Local product wheel for installing memory-base into
                        the target runtime
  --model MODEL
  --profile {agent-bubble,codex,dsh,opencode,reader}
                        Host-token defaults to agent-bubble; access-set
                        requires a profile
  --components COMPONENTS
  --lines LINES
  --timeout TIMEOUT
  --destination DESTINATION
                        New backup directory outside deployment and source
                        roots
  --backup BACKUP       Verified cold backup to restore into this installed
                        empty deployment
  --name NAME           Registered project name
  --root ROOT           Local read-only project root
  --include INCLUDE     Relative Markdown glob; repeat to add patterns
  --exclude EXCLUDE     Relative exclusion glob; repeat to add patterns
  --replace             Explicitly replace an existing source registration
  --read-scope READ_SCOPE
                        Replace profile read scopes; repeat; root grants all
  --write-scope WRITE_SCOPE
                        Replace profile write scopes; repeat
  --deny-read           Explicitly deny every read scope for this profile
  --deny-write          Explicitly deny every write scope for this profile
  --mode {enable,disable,status}
                        Automatic logon startup registration; status is read-
                        only
